            </note>
            <note corresp="#d491-f2" n="2" xml:id="d491-f2-content">
                <p>A marginal notation on another copy of this memorandum indicates that the two
                    Interior Department officials were Secretary Seaton and Hugh Stewart, (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">ibid</hi>., Secretary’s Memoranda of Conversation: Lot
                    64 D 199)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d491-f3" n="3" xml:id="d491-f3-content">
                <p>On November 3, three IPC pumping stations in Syria, including the main one, were
                    sabotaged. See <ref target="frus1955-57v13#pg_594">vol. XIII, p. 594</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
